      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/c4cdca/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-26T13:35:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just saw a couple odd interactions with Savage Mana in the mobile game and want to see if they're valid before I send in a bug report. &nbsp;I don't play Haka much in the physical game, so I'm not sure if they're correct or not.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1) &nbsp;Savage Mana vs Terraforming: &nbsp;If there are environment cards under Savage Mana and Terraforming comes out, do they get removed (and result in Omnitron being able to play more cards)? &nbsp;I was under the assumption that they're just considered generic cards when under Savage Mana</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2) &nbsp;Savage Mana vs Ammo Drop: &nbsp;Ammo Drop obviously triggers when cards are destroyed and placed under Savage Mana. &nbsp;Does it trigger again when Haka uses the power on Savage Mana?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:45.882Z",
