      "created_at": "2014-10-26T13:41:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Yes, while they don’t have text on the front, they still have the same back, which tells you what type of card they are. They are still Environment cards, and they are still in play, so they are destroyed by Terraforming. This is why promo Tempy can destroy his own cards under the great La Capitan.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Yes, because they are still Villain cards in play, and they are being destroyed.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
